[{"title":"赠高待聘","author":"陈藻","text":"待聘先生二十六，弟子满堂脩几束。\n下床一面月几千，有客市廛钱别录。\n为儿不诵杞菊篇，举箸欠鱼须要肉。\n老夫弱冠奇一秋，飘零来问君平卜。\n先生称我有隽才，满县青矜皆拭目。\n一日仅能赴三饭，折简叩扉知几幅。\n今夜酒移明夜醉，凌晨乞展黄昏速。\n四边延我入师席，席则有馀身不足。\n高子行年已若干，更度四期心从欲。\n月钱祗直晓点心，薪蔬尽此携儿畜。\n抱书谁肯访吾门，看君有是犹沾禄。\n井泉比旧百倍深，汲人绠短无麻续。\n时去技精分愈穷，时来浅学难逃福。\n贩商射利偶赢馀，便诧巧谋能润屋。\n莫待黄金当散时，舟车到处遭颠覆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23729,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初夏郊行","author":"陈韡","text":"羽檄暂稀槐昼永，出郊远眺得神清。\n田间野水纵横注，林外娇莺自在鸣。\n为羡僧闲逢寺饮，要知民乐绕村行。\n逢迎尚有山花在，见识闻香不识名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23730,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游武夷作 其二","author":"陈韡","text":"来为群元扣右扉，香生琼宇碧油围。\n前驺所过风俱静，幽鸟不惊云与飞。\n清啸一山旋暮角，和蒸九曲未秋衣。\n胜游英槩真奇遇，卷入豪端放棹归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23731,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武夷筑精舍","author":"陈韡","text":"浮世何尝有定居，惬情便可著茅庐。\n久知名利为缰锁，爱此溪山似画图。\n种菊疏篱慕陶令，栽梅浅水学林逋。\n只须此地延风月，休问君王乞鉴湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23732,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游武夷作 其一","author":"陈韡","text":"阆风元不隔扃扉，桑柘松筠匼匝围。\n溪贯一原藏曲折，山罗万象欲腾飞。\n仙坛起雾成丹灶，玉女披霞作綵衣。\n寂寂幔亭天籁息，笙箫疑向夜深归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23733,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兰陵王","author":"陈韡","text":"角声切。\n何处梅梢弄雪。\n还乡梦，玉井楼前，千朵芙蕖插空碧。\n邻翁问消息。\n为说红尘倦客。\n应怜笑、弓剑旌旗，底事留人未归得。\n淮山旧相识。\n记急处笙歌，静里锋镝。\n隋堤杨柳犹春色。\n嗟十载人事，几番棋局，青油年少已鬓白。\n漫惆怅京国。\n朱墨。\n困无力。\n似病鹤樊笼，老骥羁勒。\n夕阳不系栖林翼。\n待添竹东圃，种松西陌。\n功名休问，吾老矣，付俊杰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23734,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临江仙 陈守美任","author":"陈韡","text":"三十四年台榭，八千馀里江津。\n去时杨柳正轻颦。\n重来桃李少，不似旧时春。\n风扫半空烟雨，玉虹翠浪如新。\n可怜笳鼓送行人。\n白头梳上见，归梦枕边频。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23735,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"哨遍 陈抑斋乞致仕","author":"陈韡","text":"多病倦游，在家又贫，毕竟如何是。\n十万钱，骑鹤更扬州，是人间几曾有底。\n算一生，大都能消几屐，劳神到老成何事。\n趁齿落已双，发丝在两，归寻闲里滋味。\n不见青云路有危机。\n金缕歌声，渐变成悲。\n待思大东门，忆鹤华亭，悔之晚矣。\n休，归去来兮，北山幸有闲田地。\n地瘠宜瓜菜，引泉凿成方沚。\n这仲子蔬园，三公不换，况东陵自来瓜美。\n间走马溪头，倚阑垂钓，解衣自濯清泚。\n酿山泉、时复一中之。\n琴横膝。\n古淡无弦有音徽。\n送归鸿、暮云千里。\n蓬莱自古无路，玄圃何时到，只消曲几蒲团，镇日闲庐打眭。\n这乾坤日月，更远游、问他王子。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23736,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"陈韡","text":"寄语园丁勤刬草，有时病叟出看花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23737,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姜山前岩庙","author":"陈曦","text":"怪石崭岩势欲摧，洞门无锁昼常开。\n此心不合神明者，到此应知懒入来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23738,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姜山后岩洞","author":"陈曦","text":"春山多少雨，染出碧云堆。\n岩冷溜常滴，人閒洞自开。\n摘花香入袖，题石笔黏苔。\n茅屋在何处，桃花流水来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23739,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄友","author":"陈鳞","text":"双鱼书不至，江上又空还。\n芳草去时路，暮云何处山。\n吟床花片积，钓石藓痕斑。\n惟有思君梦，迢迢夜度关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23740,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"了斋自警六首 其六","author":"陈瓘","text":"只说为山不说休，山成日夜水横流。\n惜哉覆篑成迷复，只欠当初一掉头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23741,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"了斋自警六首 其五","author":"陈瓘","text":"仲由行行终身诵，师也堂堂带上书。\n五柳却能知此意，无弦琴上赋归与。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23742,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"了斋自警六首 其四","author":"陈瓘","text":"手在何忧弓力强，巧穷那得必穿杨。\n太和有味人人饮，谁识醒时是醉乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23743,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"了斋自警六首 其三","author":"陈瓘","text":"过时不易始为难，执处那知是变迁。\n度尽千山无鸟迹，不劳传语报平安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23744,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"了斋自警六首 其二","author":"陈瓘","text":"文书难写伏羲书，字外成篇始见渠。\n赐也能分可不可，一瓢居士只如愚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23745,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"了斋自警六首 其一","author":"陈瓘","text":"本无一字尧夫易，八十一篇扬子玄。\n今古是非那复辨，仲尼尤不废韦编。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23746,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与全州崇宁断臂和尚","author":"陈瓘","text":"少年得髓几人知，想见当年断臂时。\n此是湘山大知识，衡门堪继会昌师。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23747,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"文饶自京师还欲往昌国而风作不可渡乃为绝句戏之","author":"陈瓘","text":"欲冲高浪却沈吟，酒近瀛洲懒得斟。\n莫道颠风无好意，为君吹过远归心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23748,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"文饶自昌国以诗见寄次韵二首 其二","author":"陈瓘","text":"海邦渺渺知何在，风入高帆顷刻过。\n何似一樽湖上酒，月明安稳照寒波。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23749,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"文饶自昌国以诗见寄次韵二首 其一","author":"陈瓘","text":"百川滚滚到来休，此是人间第一流。\n鲸鬣为君翻骇浪，兰苕空自满汀洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23750,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代书简张天觉","author":"陈瓘","text":"辟谷非其道，谈空去自然。\n何如勋业地，无愧是神仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23751,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"目昏诗","author":"陈瓘","text":"壮岁漂沦懒读书，老忘休歇欲何如。\n夜窗不复留灯火，眼食齁齁一任渠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23752,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗","author":"陈瓘","text":"床头史记千番纸，世上兴亡一窖尘。\n惟有炳然周孔道，至今馀泽浸生民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23753,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自合浦还清湘寄虚中弟 其二","author":"陈瓘","text":"行彻天涯万里山，月明方照海珠还。\n瘴乡来往浑閒事，聊为清湘一破颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23754,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自合浦还清湘寄虚中弟 其三","author":"陈瓘","text":"曾近沧溟看飓风，波涛有尽海无穷。\n四年陈迹今何在，坐对湘云豁晚空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23755,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自合浦还清湘寄虚中弟 其四","author":"陈瓘","text":"瘴海只将梅作雪，湘山今见麦为春。\n晴空有月当如旧，岭北山南总照人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23756,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自合浦还清湘寄虚中弟 其一","author":"陈瓘","text":"三年已绝生还望，一日天恩到海涯。\n路过清湘犹间阔，当时何不住长沙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23757,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秀聚亭","author":"陈瓘","text":"晓色春风里，维舟一小亭。\n看山浑不倦，待得雪峰青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23758,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"花光仁禅师以墨戏见寄以小诗致谢","author":"陈瓘","text":"禅心已出包区宇，墨海翻腾作雪梅。\n三昧笔端俱戏事，定馀幽室暗香来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23759,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘太守十洲诗 月岛","author":"陈瓘","text":"月明偏照海边洲，绿水回环漾素秋。\n斗转参横群动息，桂花零落遣谁收。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23760,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘太守十洲诗 竹屿","author":"陈瓘","text":"霜姿迥出红尘外，只有鹓雏傍水来。\n别岸若寻栖隐处，轩窗须为此君开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23761,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘太守十洲诗 芙蓉洲","author":"陈瓘","text":"红云可觅无蜂去，渺渺寒波映晚芳。\n未必孤根能耐雪，且看秋艳已经霜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23762,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘太守十洲诗 花屿","author":"陈瓘","text":"红紫商量欲满枝，持春觞豆好携持。\n便须载酒凌波去，底事黄堂独赋诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23763,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘太守十洲诗 芳草洲","author":"陈瓘","text":"绿色映波千古恨，至今南浦两依依。\n我今又出江东去，多少行人宦未归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23764,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘太守十洲诗 松岛","author":"陈瓘","text":"影参岸柏童童绿，叶蔽汀兰澹澹香。\n斤斧不来人迹远，养成千尺势堂堂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23765,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘太守十洲诗 柳汀","author":"陈瓘","text":"密干参差笼月影，轻波荡漾蘸烟条。\n暑天要此清凉地，欲往何辞度小桥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23766,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘太守十洲诗 烟屿","author":"陈瓘","text":"霭霭纷纷缘底事，故来波上罩晴沙。\n莫教散入沧溟去，却恐能迷上汉槎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23767,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘太守十洲诗 菊花洲","author":"陈瓘","text":"光景不留人易老，恨无羽翼出尘埃。\n世间那有飞升药，且傍汀洲采菊来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23768,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘太守十洲诗 雪汀","author":"陈瓘","text":"谁把平毡水上开，坐看飞絮扑琼台。\n酒豪耳热笙歌沸，应怪幽人此地来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23769,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和江民表韵","author":"陈瓘","text":"传老东山水上浮，玄沙六月雪重裘。\n旧来消息今何在，千里桐江月满楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23770,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"海山楼","author":"陈瓘","text":"胜事荒湮久，高城观阁宜。\n均劳青琐客，馀事海山诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23771,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄觉范长沙","author":"陈瓘","text":"大士游方兴尽回，家山风月绝尘埃。\n杖头多少闲田地，挑取华严入岭来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23772,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄饶德操","author":"陈瓘","text":"旧时饶措大，今日壁头陀。\n为问安心法，禅儒较几何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23773,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答瑞岩湛老","author":"陈瓘","text":"示我超然句，能令滞念开。\n盍移瑞岩刹，为我入城来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23774,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题假面铺","author":"陈瓘","text":"今年不及去年秋，十顷曾无半亩收。\n好雨早随人意足，即今何地不油油。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23775,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"藏春峡四首 其四","author":"陈瓘","text":"孺子无心作聘君，使君悬榻意何勤。\n世人不道芳荪好，可是清香不远闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23776,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"藏春峡四首 其三","author":"陈瓘","text":"朝廷鹓鹭日振振，不道天涯亦有人。\n弟劝兄酬无可恨，欢然别是一家春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23777,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"藏春峡四首 其二","author":"陈瓘","text":"花落花开蝶自忙，琴閒书札日偏长。\n我来不为看桃李，只爱幽兰静更香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23778,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"藏春峡四首 其一","author":"陈瓘","text":"主人心地冷如灰，只把园花取次栽。\n峡外漫多閒雨露，直须并此入山来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23779,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"佚老堂","author":"陈瓘","text":"解组纷华远，悬车兴味长。\n身闲云去住，心净月清凉。\n老矣思同隐，归欤叹异乡。\n平生高意在，畎亩未应忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23780,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴江鲈乡亭","author":"陈瓘","text":"中郎台榭据江乡，雅称诗翁赋卒章。\n莼菜鲈鱼好时节，秋风斜日旧烟光。\n一杯有味功名小，万事无心岁月长。\n安得便抛尘网去，钓舟闲倚画栏傍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23781,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"苏文饶往昌国意颇惮之送以诗因勉之","author":"刘才邵","text":"已闻舟楫具，那得苦留君。\n雨过霜风急，帆飞雪浪分。\n长途方策足，暇日正论文。\n功业他年事，风波岂足云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23782,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和邓鲠之韵","author":"陈瓘","text":"十年三谪海边州，洛口相望阻献酬。\n曾寄远诗来合浦，又传新句落丹丘。\n身如古柏童童老，心似平江湛湛流。\n归鸟倦飞云入岫，一瓢堪乐莫回头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23783,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再泛吴江","author":"王禹称","text":"二年为吏住江滨，重到江头照病身。\n满眼碧波输野鸟，一蓑疏雨属渔人。\n随船晓月孤轮白，入座晴山数点春。\n张翰精灵还笑我，绿袍依旧惹埃尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23784,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荔枝台","author":"陈瓘","text":"满眼春花百鸟肥，绛苞丹艳大累累。\n台前采掇谁堪赠，谱外声名世不知。\n颗小不堪妃子笑，味酸犹发少陵诗。\n高坟拱木今何在，此品轩昂独恨迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23785,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送周初平","author":"陈瓘","text":"齑盐虽不饱，心与古人期。\n口体非吾养，纷华任尔为。\n经明逢地芥，颖脱看囊锥。\n两骥皆宛种，天衢好并驰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23786,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄友人","author":"陈瓘","text":"行人征辔路西东，霜叶翩翩舞乱红。\n晓色冥朦溪浸月，阴容黯澹马嘶风。\n浮生信若萍随浪，远意徒惊鸟在笼。\n万事欲穷须握手，尺书相问愧匆匆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23787,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄觉范漳水","author":"陈瓘","text":"仁者虽逢思有常，平居慎勿示何妨。\n争先世路机关恶，近后语言滋味长。\n可口物多终作疾，快心事过必为伤。\n与其病后求良药，不若病前能自防。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23788,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题正伦侄舫斋诗二首 其二","author":"陈瓘","text":"画舫名斋阁，端居事若何。\n燕知真酖毒，言即是风波。\n未便乘桴去，惟同载酒过。\n济川如有意，南去问施罗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23789,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题正伦侄舫斋诗二首 其一","author":"陈瓘","text":"此道若长川，行藏比溯沿。\n浪恬宁在我，维泛且随缘。\n野色连幽岸，溪光接远天。\n欲离平险地，常使意超然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23790,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题黄及之谷神馆","author":"陈瓘","text":"昔日传闻构馆新，标名今已几经春。\n心安即是长生路，世乐无过自在身。\n虚室久扃闲岁月，白头不减旧精神。\n蓬莱未要香山客，且作潜溪百岁人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23791,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖心亭","author":"陈瓘","text":"尘境纷纷俗累增，故寻幽径访南能。\n湖波浩渺无穷绿，寺屋高低不计层。\n诗老新吟工恼客，使君馀暇得陪僧。\n棋中得失何时了，一局输赢未可凭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23792,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"超果亮师假还山 其二","author":"陈瓘","text":"路左浆先馈，门前屦几重。\n勇归尘事掷，恬处道心浓。\n弄水知幽谷，观云想妙峰。\n深夜孤鹤唳，清露滴高松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23793,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈知府司封二十韵","author":"陈瓘","text":"锦帐含香士，高名压搢绅。\n南昌移皂盖，东颍憩朱轮。\n孝悌资延寿，耕桑赖信臣。\n优游千里治，谈笑六朝均。\n竟日庭无讼，期年俗已淳。\n休誇两岐秀，未若四时春。\n近远皆沾泽，施为固有神。\n欢讴连别壤，美绩播严宸。\n夙慕冰壶洁，终期骥足伸。\n燕閒成吏隐，萧洒得湖滨。\n烟柳笼亭槛，云波荡钓纶。\n微风牵藻荇，小棹送鲈莼。\n缪作堂中客，惭陪席上珍。\n开樽宁草草，延语每谆谆。\n龌龊才非异，吹嘘意独亲。\n摘鞍方邂逅，揽辔又逡巡。\n丽巧裁新咏，缄题及鄙人。\n曹刘风自古，李杜格殊伦。\n拜赐欣愉甚，临分感叹频。\n悠悠京国路，重染满衣尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23794,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗","author":"陈瓘","text":"大抵操心在谨微，谬差千里始毫釐。\n如闻不善须当改，莫谓无人便可欺。\n忠信但当为己任，行藏终自有天知。\n深冬寒日能多少，已觉东风次第吹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23795,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庐山诗二首 其二","author":"陈瓘","text":"庐山景何如，胜迹多已古。\n水石相回旋，天地巧排布。\n我本天涯人，未知有庐阜。\n恨不早经过，西征一何暮。\n香炉在何许，缥缈凌高空。\n却入白莲沼，令人思远公。\n高岩草堂在，吏隐居其中。\n至今三尺童，犹能话白公。\n可想不可见，山色空重重。\n水流来何远，所过生苔藓。\n自古垂飞帘，至今不能捲。\n此外犹足观，足力已困竭。\n僧居本静閒，群鸟争啭舌。\n恰欲高枕眠，魂梦恐遭聒。\n知是乘雨来，山路泥滑滑。\n阴云犹未收，明朝又西发。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":23796,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]